      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-23cbf3b6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本指引所称风险包括：信用风险、用途与合规风险、操作风险、集中度风险与声誉风险。",
      "quoteHash": "23cbf3b61211cf958a2705f4e8f4a445573e735b4cc246369486a43720d035d9",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-aa9f774e",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "风险管理应贯穿贷前调查、贷中审查、发放支付与贷后管理全过程，并与客户统一授信管理衔接。",
      "quoteHash": "aa9f774eacf5deeff1fcc3ccd25dfa4f4d37ae62668e20940ba8b45e7aa1ac07",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-b50e9031",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0004",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第四条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "贷前应重点识别：一、借款人营运资金需求的真实性与测算合理性；二、借款用途的真实交易背景；三、关联交易与股权结构风险；四、借款人所在行业景气与周期位置。",
      "quoteHash": "b50e9031c221beb17626a1e251efa872e81f5cda508d355b789da519f3e0d7d5",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-9b3d7184",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0007",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "资金挪用防范措施至少包括：账户监控、支付对象与凭证核验、回款账户约定、异常支付预警。",
      "quoteHash": "9b3d7184c2c4f9009c6754928e731eb41b67c9bf3b7e3fdfebd38e8ef890af47",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-14a80aca",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0009",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "经核查确认挪用的，应当采取以下措施之一或并用：要求限期整改、提前收回贷款、调整支付方式、下调贷款风险分类，并按合同约定追究违约责任。",
      "quoteHash": "14a80acae57d2c80064b54d6a56bfe38bf51c9ca57b209b93ef453d6a4396607",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-94856d16",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "预警信号包括：借款人经营或财务明显趋差、信用状况下降、担保物价值显著下降、法定代表人或者实际控制人发生重大不利变化、发生重大交叉违约。",
      "quoteHash": "94856d1617fee412eff36d49a14989d7f8f23473656cc03b7536ba72ae253b12",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCFIN005-20260922-81362bf8",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "RISK",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCFIN005-3af2c7a0",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-2a797e16",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCFIN005-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "预警信号处置流程为：信号识别 → 风险等级初判 → 处置方案制定 → 执行与复核 → 记录归档。",
      "quoteHash": "3af2c7a0422f21b464c424f66cc3dc451852d1f0605adea36872ad8c4198bd69",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T21:40:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "81362bf840ddf166eb375c471f248bb967b7d53b370664c0270ecd3ce2725280",
      "sourceId": "SRC-FIN-005",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-FIN-005.DEMO.md",
